#: ui/shared/views/EncryptionSetupOverlay.cpp
msgid "Your recovery key isn't saved anywhere but this device yet. Without it, you won't be able to read your old messages after you sign in again. If you sign out without saving it, it stays on this computer so you can sign back in; on a shared computer, delete it instead."
